- PostgreSQL 15+
{%- endif %}

## Setup

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone <your-repo-url>
cd {{ project_name }}

# Copy environment variables
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your settings (database URL, secret key, etc.)
{%- if package_manager == "uv" %}

# Install dependencies
uv sync

# Run the dev server
uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload
{%- elif package_manager == "poetry" %}

# Install dependencies
poetry install

# Run the dev server
poetry run uvicorn app.main:app --reload
{%- else %}

# Create virtual environment and install
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate  # or .venv\Scripts\activate on Windows
pip install -e ".[dev]"

# Run the dev server
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
{%- endif %}
```

The API will be available at [http://localhost:8000](http://localhost:8000).
Interactive docs at [http://localhost:8000/docs](http://localhost:8000/docs).

## Development

```bash
make run          # Start dev server with hot reload
make test         # Run tests
make test-cov     # Run tests with coverage report
make lint         # Lint and type check
make format       # Auto-format code
{%- if database != "none" %}
make migrate      # Generate and apply database migrations
make db-reset     # Reset database (downgrade + upgrade)
{%- endif %}
make clean        # Remove caches and build artifacts
```

## Architecture

```
{{ project_name }}/
├── app/
│   ├── main.py              # FastAPI application entry point
│   ├── core/
│   │   ├── config.py        # Settings loaded from .env
│   │   ├── database.py      # Async SQLAlchemy engine & session
│   │   ├── security.py      # Password hashing & JWT tokens
│   │   ├── exceptions.py    # Custom exception hierarchy
│   │   └── logging.py       # Structured logging setup
│   ├── models/              # SQLAlchemy table definitions
│   ├── schemas/             # Pydantic request/response models
│   ├── routes/              # API route handlers
│   ├── services/            # Business logic layer
│   ├── repositories/        # Database query layer
│   ├── dependencies/        # FastAPI Depends() functions
│   ├── middleware/           # Custom middleware
│   └── utils/               # Utility functions
├── tests/                   # Test suite
{%- if database != "none" %}
├── migrations/              # Alembic database migrations
{%- endif %}
├── pyproject.toml
├── Makefile
└── .env
```

**Data flow:**

```
Request → Routes → Services → Repositories → Database
                      ↕
                   Schemas (validation)
```

